Sure! If you plug those numbers into the Geocoding API you’ll get back a full JSON payload that includes the place name, formatted address, and other useful metadata. Here’s the exact request you’d make:

```
https://maps.googleapis.com/maps/api/geocode/json?latlng=37.4224764,-122.0842499&key=AIzaSyC5Z8Yf7l2zJvKk1xXyZtQwVnB0cDqEoP
```

